{
  "_WARNING": "LIVE REAL-MONEY CONFIG (dry_run=false). BTC/ETH/SOL only. Run on a dedicated Hyperliquid master account funded with 40 USDC and sign with that account's agent/API wallet key. Never place the master private key on the VPS. See docs/hyperliquid_golive_runbook.md.",
  "dry_run": false,
